          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 1272.3,
          "x1": 0.16484375,
          "y1": 0.7601340682215787,
          "x2": 0.8326450892857143,
          "y2": 0.9522546737609396
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "muuvtmqmm8k499",
      "name": "内嵌字幕 OCR",
      "type": "embed_ocr",
      "track_role": "game",
      "scope": "output",
      "page": "",
      "video": "clip",
      "preview_visible": true,
      "events": [
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmvnu7hl",
          "start": 54.070888194397725,
          "end": 62.779588194397725,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nI missed you, Paimon.",
          "confidence": 0.9714911580085754
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmjvom24",
          "start": 62.779588194397725,
          "end": 109.69312152773108,
          "text": "Paimon\nnd\nthat guy talking to him used some kinda \"energy\non Paimon, and she could\na feel it canceling out that other thing that was making her feel unwell.",
          "confidence": 0.9453423619270324
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmsbryk9",
          "start": 109.69312152773108,
          "end": 119.20262152773104,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nSo, Mitya helped too?",
          "confidence": 0.9780672788619996
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmx4lbht",
          "start": 119.20262152773104,
          "end": 130.31372152773108,
          "text": "Mitya\nies for leaving in such a hurry at the theater earlier. I was in a rush to verify\nsome theories.",
          "confidence": 0.9395922422409058
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmx6r04m",
          "start": 130.31372152773108,
          "end": 149.58297152773108,
          "text": "Mitya\ned that your companion is perfectly safe. We've reversed the effects that the\nmental energy had on her. The Jester specifically instructed me to do so.",
          "confidence": 0.9623546600341796
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmmnvaws",
          "start": 149.58297152773108,
          "end": 180.4304548610644,
          "text": "The Jester\nis is our first official meeting, MurderofBirds. I could not let Paimon suffer in\non for a moment longer, and so I simply took her without explanation. I hope\nyou do not mind.",
          "confidence": 0.9616654515266418
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmao4wwj",
          "start": 180.4304548610644,
          "end": 191.5916048610644,
          "text": "Paimon\nbut why would a big shot like you care about what happens to Paimon…?",
          "confidence": 0.9688252210617064
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmrgd3c5",
          "start": 191.5916048610644,
          "end": 203.6536548610644,
          "text": "The Jester\nnen you first arrived in Snezhnaya, we once spent some time together… in the\ndistant past.",
          "confidence": 0.9565823078155518
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmsrs9dq",
          "start": 203.6536548610644,
          "end": 227.19383819439773,
          "text": "Paimon\nou did mention that. And Paimon did think you seemed strangely familiar the\nfirst time we met…",
          "confidence": 0.9556843042373656
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm8gbq4j",
          "start": 227.19383819439773,
          "end": 273.08968819439775,
          "text": "The Jester\nhe reminiscing will have to wait. Mitya, let us continue with the report. What\nns, if any, did you reach from conducting the final experiment of\nour energy\nresearch ahead of schedule?",
          "confidence": 0.955945372581482
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmtgvrdr",
          "start": 273.08968819439775,
          "end": 278.59518819439774,
          "text": "Mitya\nod news is, my hypothesis regarding the Ruler of Death has been verified.",
          "confidence": 0.9859219789505004
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmsg4lr5",
          "start": 278.59518819439774,
          "end": 317.0836381943978,
          "text": "Mitya\nbad news… I recommend we suspend the experiments and Project Mistilteinn\nr notice. Currently, we have no means with which to make a breakthrough… I\nsay this purely as a scientist, guided by reason alone.",
          "confidence": 0.9557204842567444
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmj8d7xn",
          "start": 322.3055215277311,
          "end": 323.8070215277311,
          "text": "The Jester\n…",
          "confidence": 0.9395878911018372
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmoud8zf",
          "start": 323.8070215277311,
          "end": 347.8477048610644,
          "text": "The Jester\nour judgement. We shall put the project on hold… until the Ruler of Death has\nbeen/eliminated.",
          "confidence": 0.961790144443512
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmslod7b",
          "start": 347.8477048610644,
          "end": 356.3395215277311,
          "text": "Mitya\nmeans necessary, so long as it removes the threat she poses to us. Until then,\neverything we do will be in vain.",
          "confidence": 0.9736448526382446
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm69rljn",
          "start": 356.3395215277311,
          "end": 363.7969715277311,
          "text": "Mitya\nust happened, I've ascertained Ronova's goal… or rather, the trigger condition\nfor the Curse of Death.",
          "confidence": 0.9610128998756408
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm4i3yiu",
          "start": 364.08058819439776,
          "end": 366.88338819439775,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nOkay, let's hear it.",
          "confidence": 0.9491140246391296
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmqxjme2",
          "start": 366.88338819439775,
          "end": 386.88670486106446,
          "text": "Mitya\ndoing is\n\"blocking\"\nSnezhnaya's technological progress, preventing us from\n)ssessing anymeans with which to threaten the Heavenly Principles.",
          "confidence": 0.9639179706573486
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmzn2vs4",
          "start": 386.88670486106446,
          "end": 399.3157881943978,
          "text": "The Jester\nHmph, just like the little lapdog she is…",
          "confidence": 0.939276397228241
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmj4258b",
          "start": 399.3157881943978,
          "end": 408.25805486106447,
          "text": "Mitya\nS, research, or experiments that lead to technological progress can trigger the\ncurse.",
          "confidence": 0.9475035071372986
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm42k11a",
          "start": 408.25805486106447,
          "end": 419.28573819439777,
          "text": "Mitya\nfor instance, I was set to launch a final-phase energy experiment ahead of\nlule. If the experiment was successful, we could have achieved a crucial\nbreakthrough…",
          "confidence": 0.9085156321525574
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmthe5t8",
          "start": 419.28573819439777,
          "end": 437.06638819439775,
          "text": "Mitya\nd, though, the moment the experiment began, all the researchers, technicians,\nand witnesses\"died\" from the curse.",
          "confidence": 0.9710989594459534
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmjgrhzl",
          "start": 437.06638819439775,
          "end": 449.6660881943978,
          "text": "Mitya\nfort, not to mention the energy and materials we relied on Project Stuzha to\ngather for us… went to waste. In the end, nothing was gained.",
          "confidence": 0.964220404624939
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm950ch9",
          "start": 449.6660881943978,
          "end": 455.67208819439776,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\ns that mean something similar happened when we were at the theater?",
          "confidence": 0.9763268828392028
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm6e4wn1",
          "start": 455.7888715277311,
          "end": 483.6500381943978,
          "text": "Mitya\nt. During the performance, I thought of an important breakthrough regarding\nthe experiment, and wound updragging everyone into this.",
          "confidence": 0.925251841545105
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmp50bjn",
          "start": 483.6500381943978,
          "end": 549.6493048610645,
          "text": "Mitya\nire of the curse seems to be something like… when moments of technological\nprogress occur, all life in the vicinity is taken away.",
          "confidence": 0.9507941603660583
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmxp8b84",
          "start": 549.6493048610645,
          "end": 561.0663881943977,
          "text": "The Jester\nh Project Stuzha having been in effect all this time, at our nation's current\nstrength, repeated trial and error is simply unsustainable.",
          "confidence": 0.9705034494400024
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmriis5u",
          "start": 561.0663881943977,
          "end": 586.9532381943978,
          "text": "The Jester\nliminating Ronova first will it be possible to continue advancing our plans.",
          "confidence": 0.9619219899177552
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmhyv6ms",
          "start": 586.9532381943978,
          "end": 599.5825215277312,
          "text": "Paimon\nle Ruler of Death… She can just kill whoever she wants, right? That's gotta be\nthe scariest power ever! Is it even possible to beat her?",
          "confidence": 0.960001826286316
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmoevpjr",
          "start": 599.5825215277312,
          "end": 617.6505715277311,
          "text": "Mitya\nBut, one thing's for sure. She definitely can't just do whatever she wants. The\nbest proof of that is me… standing here, very much alive.",
          "confidence": 0.9575127363204956
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm3ickrw",
          "start": 617.6839381943978,
          "end": 621.8888465982374,
          "text": "Paimon\nYou're saying...",
          "confidence": 0.9678673148155212
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm9my7j9",
          "start": 621.8888465982374,
          "end": 633.5998381943978,
          "text": "Mitya\nbe easier to just kill all of us researchers for good? Why resurrect us over and\nover again? Why let us advance our technology to this point?",
          "confidence": 0.9376238584518432
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmabjpin",
          "start": 633.5998381943978,
          "end": 665.2814881943978,
          "text": "Paimon\nre saying… even the Ruler of Death has limitations we don't know about?",
          "confidence": 0.9610025882720948
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm7yeyjn",
          "start": 665.5150548610644,
          "end": 670.1697048610645,
          "text": "Mitya\nExactly, and I think that's where the key to our breakthrough lies.",
          "confidence": 0.9504820108413696
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmgj3ebj",
          "start": 670.1697048610645,
          "end": 685.7352548610645,
          "text": "The Jester\nthe\"Ruler of Death\" has always been an obstacle we must overcome. Indeed\nwe mustface\"Life,\"\"Death,\nTime,\" and\"Space.\"After all.",
          "confidence": 0.9407442212104796
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmyjlaqe",
          "start": 685.7352548610645,
          "end": 742.8089381943978,
          "text": "The Jester\n…Our goal is the Heavenly Principles.",
          "confidence": 0.944214940071106
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmz6kxij",
          "start": 742.8089381943978,
          "end": 751.7178381943978,
          "text": "Paimon\nThe Fatui… want to challenge the Heavenly Principles?",
          "confidence": 0.9656329154968262
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmfhabia",
          "start": 751.7178381943978,
          "end": 759.7592048610645,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\ntime, I've had a vague suspicion the Fatui and the Tsaritsa were targeting the\nHeavenly Principles…)",
          "confidence": 0.9724003076553344
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmdhowcd",
          "start": 759.7592048610645,
          "end": 772.2717048610644,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\ng The Jester admit it is still a shock. No wonder the Tsaritsa's goal has always\nbeen kept a secret from the people.)",
          "confidence": 0.9628751277923584
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmv9dlh9",
          "start": 772.2717048610644,
          "end": 781.9814048610644,
          "text": "The Jester\nsome rest, put the experiment out of your mind, and take care that the Curse\nof Death doesn't affect any civilians.",
          "confidence": 0.9712405800819396
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmoat3pw",
          "start": 788.3047423963176,
          "end": 813.3794381943978,
          "text": "The Jester\nhere is yet time, allow me to offer you my hospitality, \"honored guest\" of\nSnezhnaya. Is there anything you wish to know?",
          "confidence": 0.9492929577827454
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmior3v4",
          "start": 813.3794381943978,
          "end": 817.2332881943978,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nIremember",
          "confidence": 0.974853217601776
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmsqd0uk",
          "start": 817.2332881943978,
          "end": 827.7104215277311,
          "text": "Paimon\nmon wanted to ask about that when the name came up just now! what is it?\nPaimon's heard of Project Stuzha, but not this one.",
          "confidence": 0.956970989704132
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmhiup1o",
          "start": 827.7104215277311,
          "end": 847.3467048610645,
          "text": "The Jester\nw, Project Stuzha is a series of measures enacted to consolidate our nation's\nources, the greater purpose of which… is to serve Project Mistilteinn.",
          "confidence": 0.9664170145988464
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmnc00gp",
          "start": 847.3467048610645,
          "end": 855.3880715277312,
          "text": "The Jester\nthings you have encountered thus far are, essentially, for the advancement of\nthatproject.",
          "confidence": 0.9448469281196594
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmduoy43",
          "start": 855.3880715277312,
          "end": 874.8742048610645,
          "text": "The Jester\nludes the Kuuvahki Experimental Design Bureau in Nod-Krai. Researching\nas merely a facade. Its core objective was to use local resources and research\nfindings to build \"Mistilteinn\" itself…",
          "confidence": 0.9548516869544984
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmo34n3k",
          "start": 875.2412381943979,
          "end": 913.3459715277312,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\na weapon built for the final battle against the Heavenly Principles, isn't it?",
          "confidence": 0.9581626057624816
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmsyj0r1",
          "start": 913.3459715277312,
          "end": 916.7994215277312,
          "text": "Paimon\nHuh? How did you know that?",
          "confidence": 0.9729018807411194
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmw0mbo4",
          "start": 916.7994215277312,
          "end": 921.1783025893368,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nI was given some intel, and I made some deductions.",
          "confidence": 0.9701561331748962
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmrv9tvj",
          "start": 921.1783025893368,
          "end": 950.9168381943978,
          "text": "Paimon\nmust mean that thing over there! Oh, Paimon's gotta take a closer look at this\nEspecially after you guys sent so many people to Nod-Krai to work on it.",
          "confidence": 0.9666345119476318
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm9b5e04",
          "start": 951.0169381943978,
          "end": 959.8090548610644,
          "text": "The Jester\nki alone will not break through Celestia's defenses, let alone challenge the\nHeavenly Principles.",
          "confidence": 0.9409265518188475
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm0wmsnx",
          "start": 960.1760881943978,
          "end": 995.6615381943978,
          "text": "enly Principles is no doubt accustomed to combating the power of the Light\nElemental energy is simply the power of the Human Realm, converted to that\nle Heavenly Principles themselves. Any attempt to use this power against its\ncreator would be a futile endeavor.",
          "confidence": 0.9740707278251648
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmsezikh",
          "start": 995.6615381943978,
          "end": 1032.2981381943978,
          "text": "The Jester\nrefore, we have set our sights on the form of energy associated with the Third\nand the Stellar Linchpins. This may hold the potential to allow Mistilteinn to\ncontend with the Heavenly Principles.",
          "confidence": 0.9150403738021852
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmxqthyw",
          "start": 1032.5317048610643,
          "end": 1077.9604215277311,
          "text": "The Jester\nsay that by reverse engineering the Stellar Linchpins to extract the energy\nwithin, we have obtained a source of \"anti-Celestia energy.\"",
          "confidence": 0.9659626483917236
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmfvx154",
          "start": 1077.9604215277311,
          "end": 1097.6133881943977,
          "text": "Paimon\nTuvahki Experimental Design Bureau, Project Stuzha, and the new energy\nexperiments… So Project Mistilteinn is what ties it all together.",
          "confidence": 0.9692561626434326
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm3vafya",
          "start": 1097.6133881943977,
          "end": 1120.1253563087084,
          "text": "Paimon\nlike your plan is almost complete… No wonder the Ruler of Death came after\nyou…",
          "confidence": 0.9239896535873412
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmo1546c",
          "start": 1120.1253563087084,
          "end": 1135.7848548610643,
          "text": "The Jester\nthe Tsaritsa has embarked upon an expedition to vanquish a monster. Were it\nthis, I imagine she would have been delighted to grant you an audience.",
          "confidence": 0.967681050300598
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm3v6040",
          "start": 1136.0684715277312,
          "end": 1150.8665881943978,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nthe powers that be in Snezhnaya don't intend to hold my past conflicts with\nthe Fatui against me…)",
          "confidence": 0.9445489048957824
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmvakdse",
          "start": 1150.8665881943978,
          "end": 1165.547921527731,
          "text": "The Jester\ngers have been granted significant autonomy in retrieving the Gnoses. But by\nme token, they do not completely represent Snezhnaya's official stance.",
          "confidence": 0.9720638990402222
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm8ishw1",
          "start": 1165.547921527731,
          "end": 1167.7668048610644,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nYou read my mind.",
          "confidence": 0.954900085926056
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmezrakj",
          "start": 1167.7668048610644,
          "end": 1170.6697048610645,
          "text": "Paimon\nof the Gnoses, Paimon's been dying to ask this question since forever. Why",
          "confidence": 0.9821107387542723
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmssfw8j",
          "start": 1170.6697048610645,
          "end": 1187.27696982338,
          "text": "Paimon\nof the Gnoses, Paimon's been dying to ask this question since forever. Why\ns the Tsaritsa wanna collect them? Is it something to do with the fight against\nthe Heavenly Principles?",
          "confidence": 0.95421040058136
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmc1tmyr",
          "start": 1187.27696982338,
          "end": 1243.1087381943978,
          "text": "The Jester\nses will undoubtedly serve as a key bargaining chip when she confronts the\nrinciples. Beyond that… you had best ask the Tsaritsa herself. I am not sure if\nthis information is mine to disclose.",
          "confidence": 0.9533340334892272
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm3lwk4i",
          "start": 1243.1087381943978,
          "end": 1256.8724881943976,
          "text": "Paimon\nomean, \"not sure\"? Don't you make the rules? You're the highest-ranking\nharbinger… Ugh, never mind.",
          "confidence": 0.975250244140625
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmf0l2w2",
          "start": 1256.8724881943976,
          "end": 1269.3182548610644,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nthe Heavenly Principles is something most people wouldn't even entertain in\ntheir wildest fantasies. Why is the Tsaritsa so fixated on this?",
          "confidence": 0.979101538658142
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm0lrgki",
          "start": 1269.3182548610644,
          "end": 1284.6335548610643,
          "text": "The Jester\noday,\"civilization\" is nothing but an illusion, something whose very existence\ncan be\"negated\" at any moment.",
          "confidence": 0.9464208483695984
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmql810v",
          "start": 1284.6335548610643,
          "end": 1327.3929381943976,
          "text": "The Jester\nization may very well be destroyed in the struggle, but as things stand, the\ninciples could choose to negate our existence on a passing whim, and we must\nnot sit back and accept that fate.",
          "confidence": 0.931216597557068
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm2igmcg",
          "start": 1327.3929381943976,
          "end": 1346.2951548610645,
          "text": "The Jester\ninging this state of affairs, only by overthrowing the Heavenly Principles, can\nour civilization truly be said to have taken root…",
          "confidence": 0.9343279600143432
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmgwd0rh",
          "start": 1346.2951548610645,
          "end": 1359.2080548610645,
          "text": "The Jester\ne, the fate of the people of Khaenri'ah and Hyperborea is a cycle doomed to\nrepeat itself.",
          "confidence": 0.924542248249054
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmazgxp0",
          "start": 1359.2080548610645,
          "end": 1368.0556728295828,
          "text": "Paimon\nng potential destruction… in return for getting to control your own fate…",
          "confidence": 0.9726182222366332
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmsxcbd3",
          "start": 1368.0556728295828,
          "end": 1387.502988194398,
          "text": "The Jester\ne… Hm, perhaps this is still somewhat difficult for you to understand. Are you\naware that all the rules of this world are made up of \"curses\"?",
          "confidence": 0.9614742994308472
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm76x0iw",
          "start": 1387.502988194398,
          "end": 1405.3374715277312,
          "text": "Paimon\nem? Paimon knows about the Curse of Death you mentioned, and the \"Curse of\nImmortality\" that you and Dainsleif have…",
          "confidence": 0.9550006985664368
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmx63g41",
          "start": 1405.3374715277312,
          "end": 1421.236688194398,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nbirth of the Hilichurls, the rules of Natlan's Ode of Resurrection… Those are\no? Furina's long life seems to stem from a curse placed on her by Focalors as\nwell…",
          "confidence": 0.7839747071266174
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm9vef0b",
          "start": 1421.236688194398,
          "end": 1487.3026881943977,
          "text": "The Jester\n\"a god's love for humanity\"\nis a curse the Heavenly Principles inflicted upon\nthe gods.",
          "confidence": 0.932012379169464
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmlqb6sf",
          "start": 1487.3026881943977,
          "end": 1524.206221527731,
          "text": "The Jester\nTsaritsa has always had ample reason to hate the Heavenly Principles…",
          "confidence": 0.9711323380470276
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmao2489",
          "start": 1524.206221527731,
          "end": 1590.6559381943978,
          "text": "The Jester\nize their authority, she will reconstruct the entire world… and when that time\ncomes, humanity will be completely Liberated from curses and lies.",
          "confidence": 0.9617392420768738
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmon6xg9",
          "start": 1590.6559381943978,
          "end": 1605.9378715277312,
          "text": "The Jester\nLook forward to it. It will be a world beyond your imagination.",
          "confidence": 0.944471001625061
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm5nbval",
          "start": 1605.9378715277312,
          "end": 1623.5888381943978,
          "text": "The Jester\nordinary people of Snezhnaya may not understand these details, in this frigid\nd in a ceaseless struggle against the environment, in this nation to which the\ngods have never shown favor…",
          "confidence": 0.9704753756523132
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmjmnq7x",
          "start": 1623.5888381943978,
          "end": 1688.0699215277311,
          "text": "The Jester\neve that standing in solidarity with the Tsaritsa in our shared \"struggle\" will\nsurely usher in a new and better world.",
          "confidence": 0.9241235852241516
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmi02fbo",
          "start": 1688.0699215277311,
          "end": 1706.388221527731,
          "text": "Paimon\nLly doesn't remember! He's basically a stranger! You've gotta believe Paimon!",
          "confidence": 0.9733575582504272
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm1u9c8q",
          "start": 1706.388221527731,
          "end": 1717.8663548610643,
          "text": "The Jester\nexplain. The reason Paimon reacted to the \"Anti-Celestia Energy\" developed by\nthe Armory Palace…",
          "confidence": 0.9654210805892944
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmy9fqcf",
          "start": 1717.8997215277311,
          "end": 1783.2483381943978,
          "text": "The Jester\nshe comes from Celestia herself. More specifically, she is one of its creations.",
          "confidence": 0.9735261797904968
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqml7nb90",
          "start": 1783.2483381943978,
          "end": 1792.7411548610644,
          "text": "Paimon\nPaimon? A creation of Celestia?",
          "confidence": 0.955104112625122
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmk8kzr8",
          "start": 1792.7411548610644,
          "end": 1816.2980215277312,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nwas blinded by anger earlier, but thinking back on it… Ronova also said that\nn is a creation of Celestia, but she lacks Celestia's power or authority…)",
          "confidence": 0.9719476699829102
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmnwti7g",
          "start": 1816.2980215277312,
          "end": 1824.8232048610644,
          "text": "The Jester\nW, the lunar fragments in Nod-Krai… were \"pulled\" down from the sky using\nFatui technology.",
          "confidence": 0.9457563161849976
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmgsrhl8",
          "start": 1824.8899381943977,
          "end": 1837.302338194398,
          "text": "The Jester\nrst application of this technology was in Khaenri'ah, over five hundred years\nago…",
          "confidence": 0.8406221270561218
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmkoze67",
          "start": 1837.302338194398,
          "end": 1953.3075634397137,
          "text": "The Jester\ntechnology upon the heavens, and the response I received… was none other\nthan Paimon, descending from Celestia.",
          "confidence": 0.9344730377197266
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm0zvwq1",
          "start": 1953.3075634397137,
          "end": 2051.566388194398,
          "text": "The Jester\nher to the Vinster King, but he took no interest in this gift, nor did it satisfy\nhim.",
          "confidence": 0.9401551485061646
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm2hk90h",
          "start": 2051.566388194398,
          "end": 2066.1142548610646,
          "text": "The Jester\nn took up temporary residence in my palace until, of course, the arrival of the\nCataclysm.",
          "confidence": 0.9462855458259584
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmt70fyq",
          "start": 2066.1142548610646,
          "end": 2116.047471527731,
          "text": "Paimon\nlon's a little confused. You're talking about things that happened in Khaenri'ah\nfive hundred years ago! You're saying Paimon was there for that?",
          "confidence": 0.967025637626648
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmsr0roz",
          "start": 2116.047471527731,
          "end": 2130.161571527731,
          "text": "Paimon\nn doesn't remember any of that! Falling from the sky, being given away as a\ngift…Noneofit!",
          "confidence": 0.970267653465271
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm8uazja",
          "start": 2130.161571527731,
          "end": 2210.7921215277315,
          "text": "The Jester\nd through the Cataclysm, perhaps you, too, were burdened with some manner\nlthough losing your memories would indeed be the smallest price Ihave ever\nseen paid.",
          "confidence": 0.9587391018867492
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmpwbvar",
          "start": 2210.7921215277315,
          "end": 2227.1251048610648,
          "text": "Paimon\njust her memories from Khaenri'ah… Paimon doesn't even know how she spent\nve hundred years. She only has memories from the past few years,no matter\nhow hard she tries to remember…",
          "confidence": 0.9645500779151917
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm53mi23",
          "start": 2227.1251048610648,
          "end": 2257.205154861065,
          "text": "Paimon\ntimon like back in Khaenri'ah? Did she know a whole lot because she came from\nCelestia? Was she super smart?",
          "confidence": 0.962949275970459
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmxhme6c",
          "start": 2257.205154861065,
          "end": 2282.1300548610648,
          "text": "The Jester\nately, when you arrived in Khaenri'ah, your consciousness was like that of a\nrn infant… None could say what kind of being you once were in Celestia.",
          "confidence": 0.9619070887565612
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm7i2sya",
          "start": 2282.1300548610648,
          "end": 2298.546454861065,
          "text": "The Jester\ntime you lived in Khaenri'ah, your personality was no different from how it is\nnoW.",
          "confidence": 0.8618980050086975
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmibimua",
          "start": 2298.546454861065,
          "end": 2338.503038194398,
          "text": "Paimon\nimon's plan to get her memories back and become super smart is ruined before\nit could even start…",
          "confidence": 0.97517192363739
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmdhp2hh",
          "start": 2338.503038194398,
          "end": 2413.1109048610647,
          "text": "Paimon\nven though Paimon lost her memories, she still feels weirdly close to you for\nason. That must mean you took pretty good care of Paimon back then, huh!",
          "confidence": 0.9776595234870912
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmo9hfra",
          "start": 2413.1109048610647,
          "end": 2455.7868715277314,
          "text": "The Jester\ncontrary, I completely ignored your existence.I was entirely focused on my\nstruggle against Hroptatyr\"The Wise\"…",
          "confidence": 0.9634964466094972
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm9ewyt3",
          "start": 2456.020438194398,
          "end": 2471.9224827100848,
          "text": "The Jester\n, as I see it, it is as if you are the only sane thing that survived that era of\ninsanity, and thus, are worthy of protection.",
          "confidence": 0.917845904827118
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm0bdjt6",
          "start": 2471.9224827100848,
          "end": 2483.848238194398,
          "text": "Paimon\ned. Man, Paimon's gotta stop projecting friendship on everyone she meets.",
          "confidence": 0.9780824184417723
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmpgekrz",
          "start": 2483.848238194398,
          "end": 2548.713038194398,
          "text": "Paimon\nurderofBirds… E-Even though you know Paimon's some\n\"creation of Celestia\"\nnow, you still want her right? Y—You're not going to abandon her?",
          "confidence": 0.9625063538551332
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmw5v1i9",
          "start": 2548.7797715277316,
          "end": 2570.584888194398,
          "text": "Paimon\new. That's a relief! Paimon's just learning about this too. She's barely even\nprocessed it!",
          "confidence": 0.9666138887405396
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmenxg6h",
          "start": 2570.584888194398,
          "end": 2590.1878048610647,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nfor telling me so much. I'm a bit surprised, honestly. I didn't expect you to be\nquite so transparent with me.",
          "confidence": 0.9691041111946106
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmtjltls",
          "start": 2590.1878048610647,
          "end": 2641.255488194398,
          "text": "The Jester\nn the circumstances, the Fatui need not hide anything from our allies.",
          "confidence": 0.9435263872146606
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmvukpgj",
          "start": 2641.255488194398,
          "end": 2643.841404861065,
          "text": "Paimon\n\"Allies\"?",
          "confidence": 0.9719008207321168
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmvrfchj",
          "start": 2643.8747715277314,
          "end": 2662.1930715277313,
          "text": "The Jester\nProject Mistilteinn, we must first resolve our issue with the Ruler of Death.\nesume correctly… you have no intention of letting her actions go unpunished\neither, do you?",
          "confidence": 0.9442178010940552
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmiqcpba",
          "start": 2662.1930715277313,
          "end": 2672.8036715277312,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nht. Ever since she said she intends to\"reclaim\" Paimon when we next meet, I\nfigured reconciliation was out of the question.",
          "confidence": 0.9569132328033448
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmxhc9cq",
          "start": 2672.8036715277312,
          "end": 2710.7082048610646,
          "text": "The Jester\npponent of this caliber, deliberating over our allegiances would waste time we\n. We must join forces unreservedly with whomever we can if we are to stand\nanything like a fighting chance.",
          "confidence": 0.9441959261894226
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmks2kj4",
          "start": 2710.7082048610646,
          "end": 2727.664865445923,
          "text": "Paimon\ng to challenge the Ruler of Death… just for Paimon? But… but Paimon's only…",
          "confidence": 0.9441934823989868
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmbpphfx",
          "start": 2727.664865445923,
          "end": 2750.1142381943982,
          "text": "Paimon\nThank you… Oh gee, now Paimon doesn't even know",
          "confidence": 0.94399493932724
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm9y1lph",
          "start": 2750.1142381943982,
          "end": 2764.5453215277316,
          "text": "The Jester\nitsa will return in triumph in short order, and the Fatui shall hold internal\nns regarding the enemy. The time for us to meet again will come very soon.",
          "confidence": 0.9591803550720216
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmcj7x6u",
          "start": 2764.5453215277316,
          "end": 2784.3651215277314,
          "text": "MurderofBirds\nThanks for your help with Paimon. I'll be sure to look after her for you.",
          "confidence": 0.953377902507782
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmbjy9yb",
          "start": 2784.648738194398,
          "end": 2799.913988194398,
          "text": "Paimon\nas just one another thing… Well, just a request, really. Paimon reeeally wants\nthis Mistilteinn thingy you're gonna use against the Heavenly Principles looks\nlike!",
          "confidence": 0.9214690923690796
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmfn3oah",
          "start": 2799.913988194398,
          "end": 2808.1055048610647,
          "text": "Paimon\nPaimon knows it's top secret and stuff, but she just had to ask. It's okay if the\nanswer's no…",
          "confidence": 0.9363041520118712
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmmi0dh2",
          "start": 2808.5893215277315,
          "end": 2811.0751381943983,
          "text": "The Jester\nCertainly, you may.",
          "confidence": 0.943269431591034
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmnjmr5m",
          "start": 2811.0751381943983,
          "end": 2824.3050215277312,
          "text": "Paimon\neal!? Uh… A—Actually, maybe it's best not to…? What if Ronova suddenly pops\nup again? She might take this chance to",
          "confidence": 0.9214743971824646
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqm4yl03k",
          "start": 2824.321704861065,
          "end": 2838.2189215277313,
          "text": "The Jester\ntechnology is not yet fully developed, it has nevertheless reached the stage\nstia's creations are unable to damage it. In that regard, you may rest assured.",
          "confidence": 0.9681954979896544
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmpidaya",
          "start": 2838.235604861065,
          "end": 2856.587271527731,
          "text": "Paimon\nno wonder Paimon felt so out of sorts recently, even though it was super far\nit then, Paimon's ready to take a sneaky peek at this top-secret super weapon!",
          "confidence": 0.9794926643371582
        },
        {
          "type": "embed_ocr",
          "id": "muuvtmqmds0kv8",
          "start": 2894.341654861065,
          "end": 2945.9932548610645,
          "text": "Paimon\nHuh? Oh, hey there, Odette!",
          "confidence": 0.9697326421737672
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "1788972175",
  "updated_at": "1791356546"
}
